<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation on 1 August 2019. Amendment of section 6"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/eng@> .
