<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Revision of Laws Act 1968 [Act 1], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 6, by inserting after paragraph (1)(xvii) the following paragraph: “(xviia) to make such alterations in any written law to reflect any change of the style and title, or the transfer of any functions or responsibility, of any Minister, or the change of name of any Ministry;”. Amendment of section 14"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/eng@> .
