<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 14(2) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “(xvii),” the words “(xviia),”. Commencement of change or transfer"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/eng@> .
