<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any change of the style and title, or the transfer of any functions or responsibility, of any Minister, or the change of name of any Ministry, shall come into operation on the date of the change of the style and title, or the transfer of any functions or responsibility, of any Minister, or the change of name of any Ministry, as the case may be."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/eng@> .
